   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI_09">rue du Cardinal Lemoine 71</name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI">Paris</name> V</addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Dear <name type="person" key="weav76">Miss Weaver</name>: The above is my new address – the fifth removal in Paris during eleven months! I sent you some press notices and shall be glad if you will return the Italian ones when read. The removal at both ends took up a great deal of time but I am now working on at <hi rend="underline">Ithaca</hi>. The first proofs are due on Saturday.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>        	With kind regards</salute>
                        <salute>                    	sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">                                	James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1921-06-06">6.vi.921</date>
                        </dateline> </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
      </body>
   </text>
